.Dt THREAD_EXIT 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm thread_exit
.Nd terminate the calling thread
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft void
.Fn thread_exit "int code"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call terminates the calling thread.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
